OL,3,ARussia's elections had few surprises -
OL,4,Abut how the Kremlin uses the results
OL,5,Awill be crucial
OL,6,
OL,7,FMany things about Russia are hard to
OL,8,Fpredict.
OL,10,FThe result of this election wasn't one
OL,11,Fof them.
OL,13,FIn a political system tightly
OL,14,Fcontrolled by the Kremlin, the party of
OL,15,Fpower ` United Russia `had been widely
OL,16,Fexpected to remain the largest in
OL,17,Fparliament by a large margin.
OL,19,FThere were no upsets. No surprises. No
OL,20,Fother party came close.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
